{"title":"잘못된 연애방식 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"평생을 알파라고 생각하며 살았던 범규화는 여느 때와 마찬가지로\n학비를 벌기 위해 일하던 중 고액의 알바 제의를 받는다.\n그 알바 장소는 하필 피하고 싶었던 세한 호텔이지만,\n하루뿐이라 생각하고 일을 하게 된다.\n하지만, 일을 하던 도중, 페로몬이 역하게 느껴지기 시작하고 몸이 안 좋아지기 시작한다.\n그리고 그곳에서 만나고 싶지 않은 인물 중 한 명인 한해수와 만나게 되며,\n히트로 인해 하룻밤을 보내게 되는데…\n\n\"너 지금... 히트 온 거 맞지?\"","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-10-06","rank":226,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-07","rank":10,"change":{"type":"up","amount":216}},{"date":"2026-10-08","rank":4,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-10-09","rank":6,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-10-10","rank":8,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-10-11","rank":8,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-12","rank":9,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-10-13","rank":8,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-10-14","rank":11,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-10-15","rank":11,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-16","rank":13,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-10-17","rank":12,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-10-18","rank":14,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-10-19","rank":18,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-10-20","rank":20,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-10-07","rank":48,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-08","rank":24,"change":{"type":"up","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-10-09","rank":20,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-10-10","rank":14,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-10-11","rank":12,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-10-12","rank":10,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-10-13","rank":9,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-10-14","rank":10,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-10-15","rank":10,"change":{"type":"same"